    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "1. 绘制 -j∞ ≤ s ≤ +j∞ 时的 KG(s) 曲线。2. 计算顺时针包围 -1 点的圈数，记为 N。3. 确定 G(s) 的不稳定（右半平面）极点数，记为 P。4. 计算不稳定闭环根数 Z：Z = N + P。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "1. Plot KG(s) for -j∞ ≤ s ≤ +j∞. 2. Evaluate the number of clockwise encirclements of -1, and call that number N. 3. Determine the number of unstable (RHP) poles of G(s), and call that number P. 4. Calculate the number of unstable closed-loop roots Z: Z = N + P.",
